From: Anton Argirov <anton.argirov@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 17:35:06 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] fix(baseconf): match raster reads and palette writes to video output

BaseConf palette reads and beam-timed palette writes must use the color
currently leaving the video circuit, not just the border register. Share
the mode-specific pixel lookup with scanline rendering, including the ZX
multicolor attribute layout and FLASH behavior.

---
